# ============================================================================
# Kovanica Protocol monorepo — never commit secrets or build output.
# ============================================================================

# Rust build output. Unanchored so it covers every workspace in the tree:
# protocol/, node/, sdk/, ledger-app/, wallet/ each have their own target/.
target/

# JS dependencies. Unanchored (no trailing slash) on purpose: mobile/console/
# shared/node_modules is a symlink into the enterprise workspace, and the
# slash form would not match symlinked dirs.
node_modules

# Build output. Anchored forms for JS, plus the bare form for nested crates.
/dist/
dist/
.output/
.tanstack/
.vercel/

# Runtime chain data. Contains the founder premine key, operator wallet
# (possibly a 12/24-word BIP-39 phrase), validator seeds, faucet ledgers and
# peer ban state. All regenerable; set KOVANICA_DATA outside the checkout.
crates/*/data/
apps/desktop-node/data/
# Anchorless so it also covers protocol/data/ and any other nested crate —
# a pattern with a slash is anchored to this file's directory, which silently
# misses nested trees (this is what let protocol/data/alpha.snap get committed).
**/data/*.snap
*.log
.dev.log

# PoA authority private keys (mode 0600). authorities.conf next to these is
# PUBLIC (64-hex pubkeys + threshold) and is deliberately tracked — every node
# must agree on the set. Never add a secret to it.
authority-keys/*.env
mainnet-authority-keys/*.env
ops/deploy/*/data/
ops/deploy/*/keys/
ops/deploy/*/logs/
ops/deploy/*/seeds/*/keys/
ops/deploy/testnet/authority-keys/*.env
ops/deploy/mainnet/authority-keys/*.env

# Local environment. *.example files are the documented exception.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Obsidian vault: a generated projection of protocol/docs, synced separately
# by scripts/build-vault.py. See .vault-managed.
/vault/
.obsidian/workspace*.json
.obsidian/cache

# Third-party reference checkout, not ours to version.
/trezor-coin-def/

# One-off local dev bootstrap scratch.
# kovanica-clean-setup.sh deletes /root/.cargo and /root/.rustup, so keeping
# these out of the repo avoids committing a footgun.
/kovanica-clean-setup.sh
/kovanica_dev_setup.sh
/PRE-MIGRATION-LS.txt

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
*.iml